#
# Versions of the packages built for and run on the BUILD HOST.
#
# Completely unrelated to other/pkg_versions, which holds the versions
# of the packages that end up in Tilck itself. A package that exists on
# both sides (ncurses) has one entry in each file and the two may differ
# freely: the host tool and the target library have nothing to do with
# each other.
#
# Keys are prefixed HOST_VER_ so that this file and pkg_versions can
# both be sourced into the same shell (or read into the same CMake
# scope) without one silently overwriting the other.
#
